the game back after so many years of break, and now I try to play like once in a week,

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:39.360
I love the beach volleyball, but I play indoor as well.

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:45.320
Yeah, dude, I love volleyball, it's always been, you know, ever since I started playing

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:50.400
in a rec league when I was like 16, it's been my favorite sport by far, it's just this perfect

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:55.720
combination of like, it's very clutch, you know, there's lots of very, there's very like

00:16:55.720 --> 00:17:00.360
dangerous situations where you can like kind of barely survive, you know, and dive and

