get the ball back over the net, and it's also very collaborative, you know, you have to

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:10.040
work with a team, and there's nothing more gratifying than like, being a hitter, and

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:15.240
then seeing that set go up, and it's a beautiful set, and you're like, oh, I'm about to crush

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:20.120
that, you know, and then just, boom, you know, I love it, I love it.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:25.720
Yeah, I feel when I jump, when I get the timing correct, and I jump when I shoot, I just feel

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:29.240
just before, before the attack, I just feel it will be a good one.

